## Final Summary
- **Part 2:** Single-task service becomes CPU-bound under high concurrency; performance degrades as CPU saturates.
- **Part 3:** ALB + auto scaling mitigates the Part 2 bottleneck by adding tasks under load, maintaining service availability and improving throughput.
